OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloud and light rain initially
OL,6,Fto the south and east of Glasgow,
OL,7,Fwhich clears during the morning.
OL,8,FOtherwise a day of sunny spells and
OL,9,Fshowers, with outbreaks always focused
OL,10,Facross Argyll, where they build
OL,11,Fthrough the afternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers and clear spells.
OL,14,FShowers occasional across Argyll, but
OL,15,Frelatively isolated from Glasgow
OL,16,Fsouthwards. South to southwest winds
OL,17,Ffreshening across the coasts and Isles.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
